+}
+/* Desktop (catalina-patcher's Soul Mark patch): the body and the page wrappers inside it all carry
+   bg-ui-background. The body holds the picture and smoke only; the first layer inside it is the
+   page glass; full-page layers nested in that are see-through, so the page glass is one layer,
+   as on the web app (each layer would otherwise cover the picture again). */
